plan.repoLayout:
AndrewStifora/mullwise (public; pnpm 11 workspace):
- packages/{core, crypto, store, mcp-server, cli}
- plugin/{.claude-plugin/plugin.json, .mcp.json, skills/rto, workspace-template, evals/{cases, mocks}}
- .claude-plugin/marketplace.json
- phase0/rto-lab
- apps/inbox (P2b)
- tests/{e2e, fixtures (JSON bundles, never *.db), perf}
- docs/{product, research, architecture/{roadmap, adr}, security/{threat-model, review-checklist, host-hygiene}, testing, user}
- .github/{workflows, labeler.yml, dependabot.yml}

The store package is named 'store' because of the vault/ ignore rule.
